          "year": "2024",
          "text": "In humans, the process of respiration involves the following steps: A. Diffusion of gases across alveolar membrane B. Diffusion of gases between blood and tissues C. Transport of gases by blood D. Utilisation of O2 by the cells for catabolic reactions E. Breathing or pulmonary ventilation Choose the correct sequence of steps from the options given below",
