          "text": "Consider the following statements regarding function of adrenal medullary hormones: A. It causes pupilary constriction B. It is a hyperglycemic hormone C. It causes piloerection D. It increases strength of heart contraction Choose the correct answer from the options given below",
          "answer": "D",
          "chapter": "Chemical Coordination and Integration",
