          "id": "Q1",
          "year": "2025",
          "text": "Neoplastic characteristics of cells refer to: A. A mass of proliferating cell B. Rapid growth of cells C. Invasion and damage to the surrounding tissue D. Those confined to original location Choose the correct answer from the options given below",
          "answer": "D",
